From 7f06796b5e9ea000bb9153e736d53b40b9426b72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1aeo <github@1aeo.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:34:26 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] dos: Apply per-circuit stream rate and live-stream
 limits to BEGIN_DIR

Apply the per-circuit stream creation token bucket and a new
concurrent live-stream ceiling (DoSStreamCreationMaxConcurrent,
default 20) to BEGIN_DIR cells in connection_exit_begin_conn() before
allocating internal connections, and export begindir_rate_limited and
begindir_live_limited on the MetricsPort.
