+[[DoSStreamCreationMaxConcurrent]] **DoSStreamCreationMaxConcurrent** __NUM__::
+
+    The maximum number of concurrent open streams allowed on a single circuit.
+    If this ceiling is reached, actions can be taken against the excess stream
+    or circuit (DoSStreamCreationDefenseType), and excess BEGIN_DIR cells are
+    counted in tor_relay_dos_total{type="begindir_live_limited"}. If not
+    defined or set to 0, it is controlled by a consensus parameter. If not
+    defined in the consensus, the value is 20. (Default: 0)
+
 The following options are useful only for an onion service directory (HSDir).
 
